lilv: lilv (LV2 plugin host library)
lilv:
lilv: Lilv is the library hosts use to discover, load and run LV2 plugins.
lilv: PipeWire needs it to host LV2 filter chains -- without lilv its
lilv: filter-chain module has no LV2 support at all.
lilv:
lilv: Provides lv2ls, which lists the plugins visible to a host.
lilv:
lilv:
lilv: REQUIRED by asahi-audio: the LV2 host library PipeWire loads.
